# A Play Custom game through the glue (docs/phase-multiplayer.md, stage M4). The original campaign menu's Play Custom
# opens glue state 11 on the install's maps folder (--data's). Its first map is preselected with the type list's
# default (offline without a saved choice the last melee template, Free For All: FillGameTypeList 0x456910) and the
# screen's computer in the map's other slot. The drop-downs are set as a person sets them (ComboBoxProc 0x4c63b0: the
# press opens the list, the release selects the row under it): the player's race and
# the computer's Terran, so no creep spreads (its borders follow the viewer's sight: seat state since
# stage M6, out of the seats' shared hash but in sim.crc).
# Ok starts the game at once, without a ready room: the player's and the computer's start units stand. The
# simulation's state CRC is marked at a step; Quit Mission writes LastReplay.rep and opens the campaign menu (a custom
# game has no run). Load Replay lists LastReplay.rep first and its Ok plays the custom game from its own map (campaign
# row 0) to the marked step with the same state. tools/ci.sh runs it with --data on a 1.17 install that has its maps
# folder and wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
options originals
clock fixed

wait screen gluMain
click control glumain.single
wait dialog gluGameMode and still
click control glugamemode.original
wait dialog gluPEdit and still
text "Script"
click control gluPEdit.1
wait screen gluLogin
click control glulogin.ok
wait screen gluCmpgn
click control glucmpgn.custom
wait screen gluCustm
# the preselected map's information and slots (PreviewMapEntry 0x45b970's 100 ms timer)
wait seconds 0.5
# opened, a race list's rectangle covers its field and its four rows (16 + 4 x 16 pixels), so its centre is the second
# row's: Terran (Zerg -16, Protoss +16, Random +32)
press control gluCustm.28
move control gluCustm.28 0 0
release control gluCustm.28 0 0
wait frames 5
press control gluCustm.29
move control gluCustm.29 0 0
release control gluCustm.29 0 0
wait seconds 0.5
ui custom
shot custom
click control glucustm.ok
wait game
wait frames 30
log started tick units:0 units:1 creep.tiles
expect units:0 > 0 and units:1 > 0 and creep.tiles == 0
wait tick >= 160
pause
mark played
log played tick sim.crc
state played
resume
wait tick >= 200
menu quit-mission
wait dialog quit2mnu
activate ok
wait screen gluCmpgn

click control glucmpgn.replay
wait screen gluCustm
wait seconds 0.5
ui replays
click control glucustm.ok
wait game and replay
expect replay.frames >= @played.tick
wait tick >= @played.tick
pause
log replayed tick sim.crc
state replayed
expect tick == @played.tick
expect sim.crc == @played.sim.crc
